              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njalo loba ngubani oletha umhlatshelo wokubonga eNkosini ukugcwalisa isithembiso sakhe, loba umnikelo wesihle wenkomo kumbe wezimvu, uphelele ukuze wamukelwe; kungase kungabi khona ukuntula.",
          "type": "text",
