              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkunzi noma iwundlu elinokuchichima noma elishodayo, ninganikela ngalo libe ngumnikelo wesihle; kepha ngokwesithembiso ayiyikwamukeleka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
