              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi aniyikunikela esandleni sowezizwe isinkwa sikaNkulunkulu wenu nakweyodwa yazo; ngokuba ukonakala kwazo kukuzo, neziphambeko kuzo; ngeke bamukeleke kini.",
