              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho inkomo noma imvu noma imbuzi kuzalwa, kumelwe kube ngaphansi kukanina izinsuku eziyisikhombisa; kusukela osukwini lwesishiyagalombili kuqhubeke uyakuba ngumnikelo womlilo kuJehova.",
          "type": "text",
